{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1382015-eclipse-charm-index","id":1382015,"title":"Eclipse Charm Index","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-16T17:07:45-07:00","id":1382015,"title":"Eclipse Charm Index","content":"Someone will want eventually want to reference ALL the Eclipse - keyworded charms, either because someone wants to learn some or because you want to create them.<br /> So I have tried to find them. I've made a list. Let me know if I've missed one and where it is so I can add the reference.<br /> Page numbers are currently only listed for the Core as the other sources haven't made it to print yet.<br /> <br /> <b>CORE</b><ul><li>Curse of the Dead (504, Honored Ancestor)</li> <li>Broken Earth\u2019s Anguish (511, Dog of the Unbroken Earth)</li> <li>Towering Wheat Blessing (513, Field Guardian)</li> <li>Legendary Reaper (513, Field Guardian)</li> <li>Storm-Stirring Lash (514, Storm Mother)</li> <li>Wrath From the Sky (514, Storm Mother)</li> <li>Immolating Pyre (518, Garda Bird)</li> <li>Prismatic Sea-Spoor Streamers (520, Tidemare)</li> <li>Racing Sailfish Surge (520, Tidemare)</li> <li>Seductive Shapechange (527, Neomah, the Maker of Flesh, Demon of the First Circle)</li> <li>Night-Black Carapace (528, Alveua, the Keeper of the Forge of Night, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> </ul><br /> <b>HUNDRED DEVILS NIGHT PARADE</b><ul><li>Frozen Trail (Aughdeighe)</li> <li>Chilling Barghest Howl (Barrow Hounds)</li> <li>Malignant Portent Pose (Barrow Hounds)</li> <li>Wind-Whistling Trick (Cloud Person)</li> <li>Soul-Thieving Method (Doppleganger)</li> <li>Ink Clone (Flickerfeathers)</li> <li>Chromatoflage (Flickerfeathers)</li> <li>See the Sun\u2019s Reflection (Lodestar)</li> <li>Prismatic Cloud Touch (Makarios, the Sigil\u2019s Dreamer, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> <li>Tarnished Trinket Glint (Makarios, the Sigil\u2019s Dreamer, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> <li>Gates of the Dreaming Market (Makarios, the Sigil\u2019s Dreamer, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> <li>Waking Dream Affliction (Makarios, the Sigil\u2019s Dreamer, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> <li>Heartfelt Treasures Appraisal (Makarios, the Sigil\u2019s Dreamer, Demon of the Second Circle)</li> <li>Fortuitous Meeting (Plentimon\u2019s Ladybug)</li> <li>Symphony of Woe (Rantai)</li> <li>Stolen Voice (Rantai)</li> <li>Patient Hunter\u2019s Sandtrap (Steel Eater)</li> <li>Ascending to the Heavens (Storm Serpent)</li> <li>Thread-Spinning Snare (Anuhle, Demon Spider, Demon of the First Circle)</li> <li>Spread the Flame (Heartflame)</li> <li>Toxic Cloud (Rothopper)</li> </ul><br /> <b>ADVERSARIES OF THE RIGHTEOUS</b><ul><li>Municipal Perfection Decree (Adeimantus , Custodian of Utopia)</li> <li>Hundred Chambers Maze (Forlorn Manor)</li> <li>Wishful Temptation Appeal (Adeimantus , Custodian of Utopia)</li> <li>Geyser\u2019s Distant Caress (Afondha, the Lady of the Well)</li> <li>Thirst-Quenching Goddess Regalia (Afondha, the Lady of the Well)</li> <li>Fertile Benediction (Afondha, the Lady of the Well)</li> <li>Whispered Unrest (Fivefold Masks and Lies , Servant of Chaos)</li> <li>Crippling Destiny Millstone (Iolanthe, Queen of the Golden Beryl Palace)</li> <li>Searing Antipathy Attitude (Ku Nenaveya)</li> <li>Spark of Inspiration (Ninegala, Forge-Goddess of Makelo)</li> <li>Fern-Seed Blessing (The Quaghead Tribe)</li> <li>Blessing of Aton (Unrelenting Aton)</li> <li>Doomcryer\u2019s Decree (Unrelenting Aton)</li> </ul><br /> <b>Heirs of the Shogunate</b><ul><li>Storm\u2019s Caprice (Ledaal Kebok Coren, storm demon Yan)</li> <li>Wind-Dancer\u2019s Art (Ledaal Kebok Coren, storm demon Yan)</li> <li>Haled to the Horizon (Cevis Ghandarva, god Spinner of Glorious Tales)</li> <li>Legends Become Truth (Cevis Ghandarva, god Spinner of Glorious Tales)</li> <li>Beckon Back the Lost (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> <li>Festering Rot (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> <li>Fourfold Embodiment of Anja (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> <li>Keeper of Forgotten Things (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> <li>Stirring Ancient Remembrances (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> <li>Things Best Forsaken (Kumari Samathi Anja, Numen)</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 04-18-2020, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T18:29:57-07:00","id":1382027,"title":"","content":"Awesome, thanks mate! This should prove to be quite useful","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T21:46:02-07:00","id":1382060,"title":"","content":"Will update it as more develops...or if I've missed anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank